The history of the city| of Londoners’s ‘New England’ is the historical and geographical location of the city, and the first city was established in 1658.
In other words, the city had a colonial presence in London. A more extensive and diverse area of urban development, it is of great importance for the city in its historical and development history.
There are several distinct types of urban landscapes and they are:
- Western ‘New England’;
